        <mxCell id="a_morph" value="&lt;b&gt;OpenCV Vector Contours, Centroid &amp;amp; Bonn Volume Estimation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Extracts slick centroid (Lat₀, Lon₀) and metric surface area (km²)&lt;br&gt;• Applies Bonn Agreement appearance codes to derive estimated volume (m³)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#DC2626;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=9.5;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="grp_a">
